OL,3,AWhat is PHP and why did it spark a
OL,4,Aglobal cyber-security scramble?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor more than a decade, serious flaws
OL,7,Fhad gone undetected in the technology
OL,8,Funderpinning much of the internet.
OL,10,FIt took AI to bring them to light and
OL,11,Fcaused a global cyber-security alert.
OL,13,FResearchers who helped surface the
OL,14,Fvulnerabilities in PHP - a popular
OL,15,Fserver-side programming language used
OL,16,Fin web development for decades - warned
OL,17,Fplatforms which use it could be exposed
OL,18,Fto potential hacks.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
